      "widgets_values": [
        "**Text to video**\n\n1. Pick a **model** and write your **prompt**.\n2. Set **duration** and **resolution**. The lists only offer what the chosen model has.\n3. Press **Run**. The clip plays in **Save Video** in about 2 to 5 minutes and is saved to ComfyUI's `output` folder.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
